        "rewritten_query": "Transformer scaled dot-product attention rationale why use scaling factor softmax attention",
        "hypothetical_document": "The Transformer employs scaled dot-product attention to compute attention weights by taking the dot product of queries and keys, then dividing by a scaling factor before applying a softmax. This scaling counteracts the tendency for dot products to grow large in magnitude, which would push the softmax into regions with extremely small gradients and impede learning."
